    "detailed_description": "<i>Plant a tree, watch the forest grow.</i><br>Wild Souls is a chill ecosystem sim with no time pressure, inspired by Don't Starve and Zoo Tycoon. <br>Build your own world like you would a garden, experiment which animals and plant species can live together, manage and balance the populations, write YOUR stories.<br><br>You start as a Souls Keeper : a being with the power to gather the souls of recently deceased animals and plants.<br>Those souls can be offered a new life, in a new body. But which body ? You decide.<br>Decide which species you're gonna choose to <strong>build your own world, plan ahead, improvise, experiment</strong>. <br><br>As you learn the specific needs of each species, you'll get closer to a perfectly balanced ecosystem : follow the bloodines of the creatures you added, watch their offsprings grow, and witness the stories of their lifes.<br><br><i>A mysterious guide will show you the way</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/cff97eae494b081ef4560112f682dd8f.poster.avif?t=1671034397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/cff97eae494b081ef4560112f682dd8f.webm?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/cff97eae494b081ef4560112f682dd8f.mp4?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Plant a proud willow by a river. It may die, put down by a beaver or the thunder.<br><strong>Or  </strong> survive long enough to become the elder of a massive forest, shelter to many forest-dwellers animals...<br>What will it's story looks like ?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features :</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Collect souls</strong> as a currency, spend them wisely to add new creatures and plants.<br></li><li><strong>Create different biomes by painting</strong> which climate should each part of the map belong to<br></li><li><strong>Control any animal</strong> : you can now try to survive in the very environment you created !<br></li><li><strong>Observe your world</strong> evolve, see the livings interacts with each other in a lot of ways<br></li><li><strong>Follow the rythm of seasons</strong> : Winter can be a difficult time for all, but in the Spring flowers will regrow on their own !<br></li><li><strong>Relax</strong> : listen to the sounds of nature, the music, and release stress<br></li><li><strong>Unlock</strong> new species by completing little quests</li></ul><br><br><i>Seasons will change the look of the landscape :</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/2a09cd8cf82be07841da738537b25ac9.poster.avif?t=1671034397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/2a09cd8cf82be07841da738537b25ac9.webm?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/2a09cd8cf82be07841da738537b25ac9.mp4?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/57b3aec9f6f38d3df7e9c1fd775c975d.poster.avif?t=1671034397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/57b3aec9f6f38d3df7e9c1fd775c975d.webm?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/57b3aec9f6f38d3df7e9c1fd775c975d.mp4?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/67100bd97bb6f90fb17c20e2adbd6ac3.poster.avif?t=1671034397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/67100bd97bb6f90fb17c20e2adbd6ac3.webm?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/67100bd97bb6f90fb17c20e2adbd6ac3.mp4?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><i>Fire is a dangerous hasard, animals will flee before it, but some may not be that lucky...</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/7c9ec7a2326b4f2ac258f865ae7b96a7.poster.avif?t=1671034397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/7c9ec7a2326b4f2ac258f865ae7b96a7.webm?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/7c9ec7a2326b4f2ac258f865ae7b96a7.mp4?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Before you decide to get the game, you should know :</h2>Wild Souls is in its early stage of development. <br>Wild Souls will be in early access for quite a time (several months at least), and <strong>will continue to get updated</strong> (<i>new species, less bugs</i>) a long time after it's &quot;final&quot; release. <br>It's an ambitious project  made by a solo dev that I don't want to rush, or let un-updated shortly after it's release. <br><br><br><i>If you decide to start the adventure, you and your feedback will be very welcome in the discord community !</i><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/9dc771c602aff1dcfdf3e0acce8d92aa.poster.avif?t=1671034397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/9dc771c602aff1dcfdf3e0acce8d92aa.webm?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636570/extras/9dc771c602aff1dcfdf3e0acce8d92aa.mp4?t=1671034397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
